2288
01:37:56,000 --> 01:38:00,880
logic strikes a balance between

2289
01:37:58,080 --> 01:38:03,440
expressiveness and tractability.

2290
01:38:00,880 --> 01:38:06,159
It is weak enough that truth and proof

2291
01:38:03,440 --> 01:38:08,880
coincide. strong enough to formalize

2292
01:38:06,159 --> 01:38:10,800
most of mathematics,

2293
01:38:08,880 --> 01:38:13,040
but it is not strong enough to

2294
01:38:10,800 --> 01:38:15,840
categorically characterize structures

2295
01:38:13,040 --> 01:38:18,960
