2341
01:40:15,679 --> 01:40:19,760
contradictions.

2342
01:40:17,440 --> 01:40:22,000
This proof should use only methods that

2343
01:40:19,760 --> 01:40:23,520
even skeptics about infinity would

2344
01:40:22,000 --> 01:40:25,840
accept.

2345
01:40:23,520 --> 01:40:27,920
Finite combinatorial reasoning about

2346
01:40:25,840 --> 01:40:30,320
