2349
01:40:33,040 --> 01:40:39,040
Arithmetic cannot prove its own

2350
01:40:34,960 --> 01:40:42,080
consistency using only its own methods.

2351
01:40:39,040 --> 01:40:43,840
To prove arithmetic is consistent, you

2352
01:40:42,080 --> 01:40:47,280
