2354
01:40:47,280 --> 01:40:51,840
This seemed to show that Hilbert's

2355
01:40:49,199 --> 01:40:53,840
program was impossible.

2356
01:40:51,840 --> 01:40:55,600
But Hilbert's program had another

2357
01:40:53,840 --> 01:40:57,760
aspect.

2358
01:40:55,600 --> 01:40:59,920
reducing classical mathematics to

2359
01:40:57,760 --> 01:41:01,679
