3408
02:26:26,720 --> 02:26:32,479
Causality in the sense of necessary

3409
02:26:29,200 --> 02:26:34,800
connection is ideal.

3410
02:26:32,479 --> 02:26:37,200
These features belong to our way of

3411
02:26:34,800 --> 02:26:38,880
