appearances,

3419
02:26:54,240 --> 02:27:00,640
a realist about abstract structures and

3420
02:26:57,439 --> 02:27:03,280
physical laws.

3421
02:27:00,640 --> 02:27:06,560
This selective approach distinguished

3422
02:27:03,280 --> 02:27:10,080
