3444
02:28:09,520 --> 02:28:17,600
Causes preede effects locally.

3445
02:28:14,160 --> 02:28:20,399
So intuitive time is an approximation

3446
02:28:17,600 --> 02:28:23,280
useful for survival even though it

3447
