3451
02:28:34,240 --> 02:28:40,399
Locally, space seems uklidian and this

3452
02:28:38,080 --> 02:28:43,520
approximation is good enough for

3453
02:28:40,399 --> 02:28:46,399
everyday purposes.

3454
02:28:43,520 --> 02:28:49,520
Only when we consider large scales or

3455
02:28:46,399 --> 02:28:53,840
