3472
02:29:38,800 --> 02:29:43,520
How does the brain create the sense of

3473
02:29:40,960 --> 02:29:45,920
temporal flow?

3474
02:29:43,520 --> 02:29:48,800
Why do we experience a distinguished

3475
02:29:45,920 --> 02:29:51,120
present moment?

3476
02:29:48,800 --> 02:29:53,200
How do we perceive succession and

3477
02:29:51,120 --> 02:29:55,200
