3490
02:30:26,720 --> 02:30:33,600
objective temporal structure.

3491
02:30:31,040 --> 02:30:35,520
Let me conclude this part by considering

3492
02:30:33,600 --> 02:30:39,439
whether Girdle's argument for the

3493
02:30:35,520 --> 02:30:41,520
ideality of time succeeds.

3494
02:30:39,439 --> 02:30:43,439
This remains hotly debated among

3495
02:30:41,520 --> 02:30:46,439
